# Deploy bundle: a rebuildable artefact of dist/, which is itself ignored.

# Agent working files — kept locally, deliberately not published.
# HANDOFF.md is the shared change log the agents read and sign; CLAUDE.md,
# AGENTS.md and GEMINI.md are their entry points; .claude/ is Claude Code's own
# configuration. None of it is needed to build or run the site.
HANDOFF.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.claude/

# Server dependencies and its local secrets (server/.gitignore covers these too;
# repeated here so a clone from any depth is safe).
server/node_modules/
server/.env
